; Pump encoding, SUMO (pins: ontologyportal/sumo @ b1af486, Merge.kif).
; R1: parthood with temporal context -- the holdsDuring wrapper carries
; the assertion's time. Expressive in the corpus; the paper records that
; the wrapper does not survive the OWL translation pipelines.
(instance Pump1 Object)
(instance Impeller1 Object)
(instance Housing1 Object)
(holdsDuring
   (WhenFn Maintenance1)
   (part Impeller1 Pump1))

; R2: the joint, two ways. Plain spatial meeting is expressible:
(meetsSpatially Impeller1 Housing1)

; The purpose-built reified joint is natively assertable:
(connectedEngineeringComponents Impeller1 Housing1)
; ...and unsatisfiable as axiomatized: see
; probes/sumo/joint-unsatisfiability. The assertion above is well-formed
; SUO-KIF that no model of the corpus's own axioms can make true.
